NAME='Jupiter'
COVER_SUB='How you grow and where luck finds you, sign by sign.'
T=[
("Bold","Jupiter in Aries expands through courage and initiative. You are optimistic, adventurous and willing to take a leap, and you grow by leading, pioneering and standing for yourself. Luck favours those who start. The shadow is overconfidence and impatience. The lesson: faith works best with a plan."),
("Abundant","Jupiter in Taurus expands through patience, work and the senses. You enjoy abundance, good food, nature and security, and money tends to grow steadily. You are generous in a practical way. The shadow is indulgence and complacency. The lesson: enough is a real amount."),
("Detriment","Jupiter in Gemini is in detriment: curiosity is large, focus is small. You learn from everything, talk to everyone and enjoy variety, but you may skim the surface of big questions. The shadow is scattered beliefs and opinions without roots. The lesson: choose the idea worth following to the end."),
("Exalted","Jupiter is exalted in Cancer: generosity, protection and emotional wisdom. You grow through family, home, care and the people you take in. Kindness is natural and rewarded. Intuition is strong. The shadow is overprotection and sentimentality. The lesson: nourishing others is easiest when you are fed yourself."),
("Generous","Jupiter in Leo expands through confidence, creativity and warmth. You are generous, loyal and natural at leading and entertaining. You grow by being seen and by encouraging others. The shadow is pride and showing off. The lesson: the best leaders make others bigger."),
("Detriment","Jupiter in Virgo is in detriment: wisdom comes through detail, service and practical skill. You are helpful and analytical, but can lose the larger vision in the checklist. Growth arrives through work, health and craft. The shadow is perfectionism and worry. The lesson: trust that the whole is more than its parts."),
("Sociable","Jupiter in Libra expands through relationships, fairness and culture. You are diplomatic, sociable and attracted to justice, art and partnership. Luck often comes through other people. The shadow is indecision and overreliance on others. The lesson: wisdom is knowing what you want as well as what is fair."),
("Deep","Jupiter in Scorpio expands through depth, transformation and shared resources. You are drawn to psychology, mystery, research and rebirth, and you grow through crisis. The shadow is obsession and secrecy. The lesson: abundance includes what you let go of."),
("Own sign","Jupiter is at home in Sagittarius: optimism, faith and love of truth. You grow through travel, study, philosophy and teaching, and you inspire others with a large vision. Luck follows your honesty. The shadow is dogmatism and exaggeration. The lesson: a belief becomes wise when it can be questioned."),
("Fall","Jupiter is in its fall in Capricorn: optimism meets structure and has to prove itself. You grow slowly, through discipline, responsibility and long-term effort, and you are sceptical of easy promises. The shadow is pessimism and rigid ambition. The lesson: faith in the long road is also a kind of luck."),
("Visionary","Jupiter in Aquarius expands through ideas, community and the future. You are humanitarian, original and drawn to science, networks and reform. You grow through friends and shared goals. The shadow is abstract idealism and detachment. The lesson: a better world also begins with someone close."),
("Own sign","Jupiter is at home in Pisces: faith, compassion and imagination. You grow through spirituality, art, service and trust, and you feel connected to something larger. Generosity has no limit. The shadow is naivety and escapism. The lesson: faith needs good boundaries."),
]
